repository-code: "https://github.com/aliildan/signrule-decide"
url: "https://huggingface.co/aildan/signrule-decide-4b"
abstract: >-
  A 4B-parameter typed decision model that reads the signing / representation rule of a company as
  published by an official commercial register, together with the registered roles, and answers
  fixed questions (can a managing director act alone, which coalitions can bind the company, how
  many signatures are needed) with calibrated probabilities and an abstention option, without
  generating text. Trained only on labels from the registers themselves (Norway's rule
  interpreter, Austrian court codes); evaluated on Austrian, Norwegian and Danish reference sets.
keywords:
  - know-your-business
  - company register
  - Firmenbuch
  - signing rules
  - calibration
  - selective prediction
  - decision model
